flowchart TD
  Need[Need to move records?] --> Q1{Target fields exist?}
  Q1 -->|No| Meta[Metadata deploy first]
  Q1 -->|Yes| Q2{Have External IDs and parent-first order?}
  Q2 -->|No| Plan[Stop and plan keys and sequence]
  Q2 -->|Yes| Q3{Rehearsed in a sandbox that can hold the volume?}
  Q3 -->|Developer only tiny data| WrongHall[Do not call it proven]
  Q3 -->|Yes and reconciled| Q4{Production backup taken?}
  Q4 -->|No| Bak[Export or backup first]
  Q4 -->|Yes| Load[Load with upsert; keep error files]
  Load --> Q5{Need to undo?}
  Q5 -->|Deletes in bin| Und[undelete]
  Q5 -->|Overwrites| Rest[Reload pre-image]
  Q5 -->|One API call failed closed| AON[AllOrNoneHeader already rolled that call back]
